      "act": "BLUF",
      "role_note": "EXECUTIVE-SUMMARY LAW; misconception: ask the model every time.",
      "narration_text": "The idea: routine decisions run as plain code, and the model is asked only when that code is unsure. That saves the model for the questions that really need it.",
